  "tagline": "Himalayan kingdom of dzongs, prayer flags and the Tiger's Nest",
  "summary": "Bhutan's capital Thimphu has no traffic lights, just dzongs, monasteries and mountain views. See the giant Buddha Dordenma, the Tashichho Dzong at dusk, the takin at Motithang, and drive over the 108 chortens of Dochula Pass before hiking to Paro's cliffside Tiger's Nest monastery.",
  "days": 4,
  "bestMonths": [
    3,
