    5,
    10,
    11
  ],
  "seasonNote": "Spring and autumn bring clear skies and festivals; summer is monsoon; winter is cold but clear.",
  "arrival": "Fly into Paro (about 90 minutes from Thimphu); visits require a licensed guide and the daily fee.",
  "gettingAround": "Your guide and driver handle transport.",
  "cashTip": "Prices are shown in US dollars; locally you pay in ngultrum (pegged to the Indian rupee). Visitors pay a Sustainable Development Fee of 100 US dollars per night and must book through a licensed operator.",
